  "content": "\n\n<h1>SlashBlade 武器視檢</h1>\n<p>一款為經典的拔刀劍（SlashBlade）模組增添帥氣武器視檢功能的 Minecraft 模組。</p>\n<h2>目前功能：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>按下 <strong>G</strong> 鍵即可觸發拔刀劍的帥氣視檢動畫。</li>\n<li>遊戲內絲滑且極具沉浸感的武器觀賞體驗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>若有建議或發現錯誤，請：</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues &middot; Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>或</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests &middot; Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Github：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect：在 Minecraft 中按下 G 鍵視檢你的拔刀劍！</a></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>授權條款：</strong></span> <strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT license</a></span></strong></p>\n<p>&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</p>\n<p>為經典的拔刀劍（SlashBlade）模組增添帥氣武器視檢功能！</p>\n<h5>目前提供的功能：</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>按下 <strong>G</strong> 鍵即可觸發拔刀劍的視檢（Inspect）動作，全方位欣賞你的愛刀。</li>\n<li>遊戲內絲滑且極具沉浸感的武器觀賞體驗。</li>\n</ul>\n<h5><strong>若有建議或發現錯誤，請：</strong></h5>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues &middot; Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>或</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests &middot; Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p>\n<h5><strong>Github：</strong></h5>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect：為經典的拔刀劍模組增添帥氣武器視檢功能！</a></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>授權條款：</strong> <strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT license</a></span></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>支持我們：</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fmewkooo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_ecd5707f-8a0d-4b69-b75b-ed3107aa150b.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
